--- !u!114 &1554496711
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1554496710}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 3 | Ders 9 | D\xF6nd\xFCrme"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. HedefeBak beti\u011Fi Ucak2 nesnesine
    eklenmi\u015F ve Hedef alan\u0131 doldurulmu\u015Ftur. Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n,
    Ucak2 hedefe d\xF6ner.\n\nSoldaki u\xE7akta Euler a\xE7\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131
    \xFC\xE7 s\xFCrg\xFCyle de\u011Fi\u015Ftiriyor ve \xFC\xE7 halkayla izliyoruz.
    X a\xE7\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 90 dereceye getirdi\u011Fimizde iki halkan\u0131n
    ayn\u0131 d\xFCzleme geldi\u011Fini ve bir d\xF6nme serbestli\u011Finin kayboldu\u011Funu
    g\xF6r\xFCyoruz. Sa\u011Fdaki u\xE7a\u011F\u0131 ise quaternion fonksiyonlar\u0131yla
    hedefine en k\u0131sa yoldan d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders09_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n ve Hierarchy'de Ucak nesnesini se\xE7in.
    GimbalGoster bile\u015Fenindeki Y, X ve Z s\xFCrg\xFClerini s\u0131rayla oynat\u0131n.
    Her s\xFCrg\xFC u\xE7a\u011F\u0131 farkl\u0131 bir y\xF6nde d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCr.
    S\xFCrg\xFCleri s\u0131f\u0131ra al\u0131n."
  - "Y s\xFCrg\xFCs\xFCn\xFC 60 yap\u0131n. K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 ve mavi halkalar
    birlikte d\xF6ner, ye\u015Fil halka yerinde kal\u0131r. S\xFCrg\xFCy\xFC s\u0131f\u0131ra
    al\u0131n."
  - "X s\xFCrg\xFCs\xFCn\xFC yava\u015F\xE7a 90 de\u011Ferine getirin. Mavi halka
    ye\u015Fil halkayla ayn\u0131 d\xFCzleme gelir. Yaz\u0131 k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya
    d\xF6ner ve G\u0130MBAL K\u0130L\u0130D\u0130 yazar."
  - "X s\xFCrg\xFCs\xFC 90 iken \xF6nce Y s\xFCrg\xFCs\xFCn\xFC, sonra Z s\xFCrg\xFCs\xFCn\xFC
    oynat\u0131n. \u0130kisi de u\xE7a\u011F\u0131 ayn\u0131 eksen etraf\u0131nda
    d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCr. S\xFCrg\xFCleri s\u0131f\u0131ra al\u0131n."
  - "X s\xFCrg\xFCs\xFCn\xFC 180 yap\u0131n ve yaz\u0131daki quaternion de\u011Ferini
    okuyun. Sonra X de\u011Ferini 0, Y ve Z de\u011Ferlerini 180 yap\u0131n. U\xE7a\u011F\u0131n
    duru\u015Fu ve quaternion de\u011Feri ayn\u0131d\u0131r. S\xFCrg\xFCleri s\u0131f\u0131ra
    al\u0131n."
  - "Project penceresinde Betikler klas\xF6r\xFCndeki HedefeBak beti\u011Fini a\xE7\u0131n
    ve Update fonksiyonunu okuyun."
  - "HedefeBak beti\u011Fini Ucak2 nesnesine ekleyin. Hedef nesnesini beti\u011Fin
    Hedef alan\u0131na s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Ucak2 hedefe
    yumu\u015Fak bi\xE7imde d\xF6ner."
  - "Play modundayken Scene penceresinde Hedef nesnesini u\xE7a\u011F\u0131n \xFCst\xFCne,
    alt\u0131na ve arkas\u0131na s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. U\xE7ak her seferinde en k\u0131sa
    yoldan d\xF6ner. Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  kendinDene:
  - "X s\xFCrg\xFCs\xFCn\xFC 89 yap\u0131n ve Y ile Z s\xFCrg\xFClerini oynat\u0131n.
    \u0130ki hareket birbirine ne kadar benziyor?"
  - "Ucak2 nesnesinde Donus Hizi de\u011Ferini 20 ve 360 yaparak Play modunda deneyin."
  - "HedefeBak beti\u011Finde `Quaternion.LookRotation(yon)` yerine `Quaternion.LookRotation(-yon)`
    yaz\u0131n. U\xE7ak nereye bak\u0131yor?"
  - "Ucak nesnesinde GimbalGoster bile\u015Fenini kapat\u0131n ve Transform bile\u015Fenindeki
    Rotation de\u011Ferlerini elle de\u011Fi\u015Ftirin. S\xFCrg\xFClerle ayn\u0131
    sonucu al\u0131yor musunuz?"
